cards.rules_text:
When Slayer's Blade enters, any number of target players each mill four cards.
Equipped creature gets +X/+0 where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard.
Equip {2}

Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has “{T}: Surveil 1.” [i](To surveil 1, look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)[/i]
Equip {2}
Equip Rebel {0}

Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has protection from mana value 1 or less and protection from mana value 5 or greater.
Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a nonland nontoken permanent and you create a Gear token. [i](It's an artifact with “{1}, Sacrifice this artifact: Untap target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery.”)[/i]
Equip {2}

